# Tailwind CSS 4.1 Patterns for Angular

This rule defines patterns for using Tailwind CSS 4.1 in Angular applications.

## Core Principles

1. **Tailwind 4.1**: Use latest features and syntax
2. **CSS-First Configuration**: Use `@theme` in CSS files
3. **Component Classes**: Reusable control styles
4. **Utility Classes**: Layout and spacing only
5. **Three-Layer Architecture**: Utilities → Controls → Components
6. **Angular Integration**: Work with Angular's styling system

---

## Tailwind 4.1 Configuration

### ✅ CORRECT: CSS-first configuration with @theme

```css
/* src/styles.css */
@import "tailwindcss";

/* Tailwind 4.1: Define theme with @theme directive */
@theme {
  /* Colors */
  --color-brand-red-600: #C41F1D;
  --color-brand-red-700: #A01816;
  --color-brand-red-50: #FEF2F2;
  
  --color-text-primary: #1A1A1A;
  --color-text-secondary: #666666;
  --color-text-on-brand: #FFFFFF;
  
  --color-surface-primary: #FFFFFF;
  --color-surface-secondary: #F9FAFB;
  --color-surface-hover: #F3F4F6;
  
  --color-border-default: #E5E7EB;
  --color-border-focus: #C41F1D;
  
  /* Spacing */
  --spacing-18: 4.5rem;
  --spacing-88: 22rem;
  
  /* Font Family */
  --font-sans: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
  --font-heading: 'Inter var', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
  
  /* Border Radius */
  --radius-DEFAULT: 0.5rem;
  --radius-lg: 0.75rem;
  --radius-xl: 1rem;
  
  /* Shadows */
  --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px 0 rgb(0 0 0 / 0.05);
  --shadow-DEFAULT: 0 1px 3px 0 rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1), 0 1px 2px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);
  --shadow-md: 0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1), 0 2px 4px -2px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);
  --shadow-lg: 0 10px 15px -3px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1), 0 4px 6px -4px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);
}

/* Component Classes */
@layer components {
  /* Buttons */
  .btn-primary {
    @apply inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2;
    @apply px-4 py-2 rounded-lg;
    @apply bg-brand-red-600 text-text-on-brand font-semibold;
    @apply hover:bg-brand-red-700;
    @apply focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-red-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2;
    @apply transition-colors duration-200;
    @apply disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed;
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    @apply inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2;
    @apply px-4 py-2 rounded-lg;
    @apply bg-surface-secondary text-text-primary font-semibold;
    @apply border border-border-default;
    @apply hover:bg-surface-hover;
    @apply focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-red-600 focus-visible:ring-offset-2;
    @apply transition-colors duration-200;
    @apply disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed;
  }

  .btn-ghost {
    @apply inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2;
    @apply px-4 py-2 rounded-lg;
    @apply text-text-primary font-semibold;
    @apply hover:bg-surface-hover;
    @apply focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-red-600;
    @apply transition-colors duration-200;
  }

  /* Inputs */
  .input {
    @apply w-full px-4 py-2 rounded-lg;
    @apply border border-border-default bg-surface-primary;
    @apply text-text-primary placeholder:text-text-secondary;
    @apply focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-border-focus focus:border-transparent;
    @apply transition-colors duration-200;
    @apply disabled:bg-surface-secondary disabled:cursor-not-allowed;
  }

  .input-checkbox {
    @apply w-4 h-4 rounded border-border-default;
    @apply text-brand-red-600 focus:ring-brand-red-600 focus:ring-offset-0;
    @apply transition-colors duration-200;
  }

  .label {
    @apply block text-sm font-medium text-text-primary mb-2;
  }

  /* Cards */
  .card {
    @apply bg-surface-primary rounded-lg shadow-sm;
    @apply border border-border-default;
  }

  .card-hover {
    @apply card transition-shadow duration-200;
    @apply hover:shadow-md;
  }

  /* Links */
  .link-nav {
    @apply text-sm text-text-primary;
    @apply hover:text-brand-red-600;
    @apply focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-red-600;
    @apply transition-colors duration-200;
  }
}

/* Utilities */
@layer utilities {
  .text-balance {
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
}
```

### Tailwind 4.1 config file (minimal):

```typescript
// tailwind.config.ts
import type { Config } from 'tailwindcss';

export default {
  content: [
    './src/**/*.{html,ts}',
  ],
} satisfies Config;
```

### Angular configuration:

```json
// angular.json
{
  "projects": {
    "your-app": {
      "architect": {
        "build": {
          "options": {
            "styles": [
              "src/styles.css"
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

### ❌ WRONG: Old Tailwind 3.x configuration style

```javascript
// ❌ BAD: Tailwind 3.x style (not 4.1)
module.exports = {
  theme: {
    extend: {
      colors: {
        'brand-red': {
          600: '#C41F1D',
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

